### Workload service read API (updates come via ActiveMQ from Gym CRM)
@workloadHost = http://localhost:8082
@jwt = PASTE_JWT_FROM_GYM_CRM_REGISTER_OR_LOGIN

### Usage hint
GET {{workloadHost}}/workload

### Get month hours — expect trainingSummaryDuration after Gym CRM creates a training
GET {{workloadHost}}/workload/Mike.Brown/2026/8
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Get nested summary
GET {{workloadHost}}/workload/Mike.Brown
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Health
GET {{workloadHost}}/actuator/health
